{
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for hand hardware. firmware/esp32_hand/config.h is GENERATED",
    "from this file by tools/gen_hand_config.py -- edit here, not there.",
    "",
    "PLACEHOLDERS: pin assignments, finger->motor roles, and durations are unconfirmed.",
